Package: peerloom-seeder
Version: __VERSION__
Architecture: __ARCH__
Maintainer: PeerLoom LLC <noreply@peerloomllc.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: systemd, libc6
Recommends: curl, pkexec | policykit-1
Suggests: xdg-utils
Installed-Size: __SIZE__
Homepage: https://peerloomllc.com
Description: Keeps your PeerLoom apps in sync while your phones sleep
 PeerLoom Seeder keeps a copy of your PeerLoom apps' shared lists, files and
 spaces on a computer that stays on, so a phone that wakes up catches up even
 when nobody else is online. It stores that data scrambled and cannot read it.
 Runs as a systemd user service with a dashboard at http://127.0.0.1:8761 for
 pairing phones.
